WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:32.839 --> 00:01:35.672
I can't believe that worked!

00:01:36.943 --> 00:01:41.880
Why'd it take me so long to
think of something this simple?!

00:01:51.525 --> 00:01:55.262
Tiptoe... through the tulips...

00:01:55.262 --> 00:01:59.833
If I fold up my comforter, it
seals up the Dimension Tunnel exit!

00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:01.134
This means

00:02:01.134 --> 00:02:05.264
I can finally get some peace and
quiet away from Ryoko and the others...

00:02:06.206 --> 00:02:10.165
...who are over here day and night,
making enough racket to wake the dead!

00:02:16.616 --> 00:02:20.654
Before anyone wakes up and
butts in, I'll be alone with Tenchi...

00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:22.689
Alone with Tenchi...

00:02:22.689 --> 00:02:24.157
No, Tenchi! Not there!

00:02:24.157 --> 00:02:25.522
No!

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.196
So here I come, Tenchi!

00:02:29.196 --> 00:02:31.898
Let's set the sheets
on fire, just you and me!

00:02:31.898 --> 00:02:33.627
Here I come!

00:02:34.468 --> 00:02:35.535
Wh-What the?

00:02:35.535 --> 00:02:39.439
Ow! The tunnel's blocked!

00:02:39.439 --> 00:02:40.707
What the heck?

00:02:40.707 --> 00:02:44.411
My love won't change, no
matter what stands in my way!

00:02:44.411 --> 00:02:46.538
I'm gonna bust my way through!

00:02:48.415 --> 00:02:49.973
It's an earthquake!

00:02:57.023 --> 00:02:58.957
Ow...

00:02:59.559 --> 00:03:00.894
Huh? Tenchi!

00:03:00.894 --> 00:03:05.031
Thank goodness! I thought
I'd never see you again!

00:03:05.031 --> 00:03:08.401
L-I know that voice... Ryoko.

00:03:08.401 --> 00:03:12.272
Are you hurt? I'm hurt, too.

00:03:12.272 --> 00:03:15.141
When you're hurt, the
best thing to do is lie down.

00:03:15.141 --> 00:03:18.304
Come on, Tenchi. We'll lie down together.

00:03:18.645 --> 00:03:20.580
Huh? Hey! Cut it out, Ryoko!

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.149
You don't have to play coy with me!

00:03:23.149 --> 00:03:24.639
Look!

00:03:25.886 --> 00:03:31.525
That big boy out there is burning
as bright as ever this morning.

00:03:31.525 --> 00:03:34.928
So let's be like that rising sun
and light some fires of our own!

00:03:34.928 --> 00:03:36.862
Damn it, stop that!

00:03:37.564 --> 00:03:39.199
Tokyo and Okayama...

00:03:39.199 --> 00:03:42.802
A man and woman living
apart pass a tender moment,

00:03:42.802 --> 00:03:45.472
bathed in the gentle morning sun!

00:03:45.472 --> 00:03:47.838
Oh, how romantic!

00:03:48.875 --> 00:03:51.378
Be gentler, would you?

00:03:51.378 --> 00:03:53.539
What're you talking about?!

00:03:56.483 --> 00:03:58.552
What's the big idea, Tenchi?

00:03:58.552 --> 00:04:01.555
Ryoko! I'm gonna spell it
out for you just this once!

00:04:01.555 --> 00:04:05.091
Stop coming here to Tokyo all the time!

00:04:05.091 --> 00:04:08.962
When I need to see you,
I'll call you! <i>Got it?!</i>

00:04:08.962 --> 00:04:11.298
Tenchi? Tenchi!

00:04:11.298 --> 00:04:13.633
Wait, Tenchi!

00:04:13.633 --> 00:04:17.125
Answer me, Tenchi!

00:04:18.238 --> 00:04:21.374
What's going on? It's the crack of dawn!

00:04:21.374 --> 00:04:23.968
What's up, Ryoko?

00:04:25.879 --> 00:04:29.049
Maybe I was too hard on her.

00:04:29.049 --> 00:04:31.142
Oh, man! I've gotta get going!

00:04:35.155 --> 00:04:37.591
When the comforter is
folded up, it forms a solid wall,

00:04:37.591 --> 00:04:40.594
sealing off the Dimension Tunnel.

00:04:40.594 --> 00:04:42.462
Hm, I see.

00:04:42.462 --> 00:04:45.298
Y-You're always so calm about things...

00:04:45.298 --> 00:04:49.736
But this means we won't be able
to see Tenchi whenever we want.

00:04:49.736 --> 00:04:53.006
We'll just have to put up with it, I suppose.

00:04:53.006 --> 00:04:54.769
This, and everything else...

00:04:55.408 --> 00:04:58.707
...is all your fault, Ryoko!

00:05:00.814 --> 00:05:06.844
Oh, Lord Tenchi...
Now we really are kept apart!

00:05:07.687 --> 00:05:09.518
Washu?

00:05:10.757 --> 00:05:13.760
Isn't there something you can do?

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.763
No. So long as that end stays closed,

00:05:16.763 --> 00:05:20.166
the Dimension Tunnel can't be used at all.

00:05:20.166 --> 00:05:22.134
In that case...

00:05:22.902 --> 00:05:26.840
...come up with something that'll
at least let us see what he's up to!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.640
L-I'll see what I can do.

00:05:43.857 --> 00:05:45.725
'Morning, Masaki.

00:05:45.725 --> 00:05:47.661
Hey, Tsuchida. Good morning.

00:05:47.661 --> 00:05:49.796
You're out here working
your tail off every morning...

00:05:49.796 --> 00:05:53.233
Talk about the proverbial
morning routine for priests in training.

00:05:53.233 --> 00:05:54.067
I guess.

00:05:54.067 --> 00:05:57.437
Well, I'm not inheriting the shrine,
so it's got nothing to do with me.

00:05:57.437 --> 00:05:59.606
R-Really?

00:05:59.606 --> 00:06:02.842
Anyway, if you don't hurry,
you'll be late for school.

00:06:02.842 --> 00:06:05.743
It's time for school already?! Damn!

00:06:14.454 --> 00:06:16.445
I made it!

00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:20.527
'Morning!

00:06:20.527 --> 00:06:21.755
'Morning.

00:06:23.697 --> 00:06:24.925
Good morning!

00:06:28.134 --> 00:06:30.068
Now reporting!

00:06:33.807 --> 00:06:35.008
Now receiving!

00:06:35.008 --> 00:06:36.976
See? Here it comes.

00:06:40.346 --> 00:06:42.248
There he is! There he is!

00:06:42.248 --> 00:06:43.683
- Tenchi!
- Lord Tenchi!

00:06:43.683 --> 00:06:47.954
See? With these, we can keep
tabs on all of Tenchi's movements.

00:06:47.954 --> 00:06:51.024
So, what do you think of the Washu
Special Ultra-Compact Spy Camera,

00:06:51.024 --> 00:06:52.292
"Mr. Surveillance"?

00:06:52.292 --> 00:06:54.327
I knew you could do it, Washu!

00:06:54.327 --> 00:06:55.929
- Tenchi!
- Lord Tenchi!

00:06:55.929 --> 00:07:02.102
Now, I'm sure you want to know how
data is sent from Tokyo to Okayama...

00:07:02.102 --> 00:07:05.196
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend.

00:07:06.773 --> 00:07:09.640
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend.

00:07:11.177 --> 00:07:14.271
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend.

00:07:15.715 --> 00:07:18.650
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend.

00:07:20.153 --> 00:07:23.316
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend.

00:07:24.657 --> 00:07:27.717
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend.

00:07:30.196 --> 00:07:32.999
Tenchi is having a pleasant
conversation with his friend!

00:07:32.999 --> 00:07:36.402
And so, dozens of Mr. Surveillances
are placed between here and Tokyo

00:07:36.402 --> 00:07:40.507
acting as relay antennas,
transmitting information.

00:07:40.507 --> 00:07:44.876
Admittedly, there is a slight
time lag in the data transmission...

00:07:45.812 --> 00:07:49.115
Looks like two of 'em
weren't paying attention.

00:07:49.115 --> 00:07:50.784
Tenchi...

00:07:50.784 --> 00:07:52.786
Lord Tenchi...

00:07:52.786 --> 00:07:56.823
They don't care, just so long
as they know what Tenchi's up to.

00:07:56.823 --> 00:07:58.916
Looks that way.

00:08:03.163 --> 00:08:04.494
Tenchi!

00:08:22.649 --> 00:08:25.641
You two are so rude!

00:08:27.453 --> 00:08:29.355
It's that girl again!

00:08:29.355 --> 00:08:31.880
"Sakuya Kumashiro," right?

00:08:34.661 --> 00:08:38.097
That floozy is trying to
get her mitts on Tenchi again!

00:08:38.097 --> 00:08:41.935
We need to keep a close eye on this one.

00:08:41.935 --> 00:08:46.372
Damn it, if I could just
go see Tenchi now, I'd...

00:08:53.379 --> 00:08:57.817
I could never get bored
watching these people.

00:08:57.817 --> 00:09:01.621
But it troubles me when
they do such things as this.

00:09:01.621 --> 00:09:03.179
All right, then...

00:09:13.032 --> 00:09:15.227
"Office <i>#10:</i> XY Produce"

00:09:16.169 --> 00:09:18.538
"Nature Land"

00:09:18.538 --> 00:09:20.840
"Nature Land"
W-What? But... But this is so sudden!

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.942
W-What? But... But this is so sudden!

00:09:22.942 --> 00:09:27.947
Didn't we swear that no
matter how far apart we were,

00:09:27.947 --> 00:09:30.283
our hearts would still be one?

00:09:30.283 --> 00:09:32.685
What? You've gotten over me?

00:09:32.685 --> 00:09:34.687
B-But why?

00:09:34.687 --> 00:09:37.323
Don't hang up! I love you!

00:09:37.323 --> 00:09:39.951
What do you mean, "Goodbye"? Please! Wait!

00:09:53.273 --> 00:09:56.442
She said she wanted to be
able to hear my voice anytime,

00:09:56.442 --> 00:09:59.240
so I blew all that money on this cell phone!

00:10:01.281 --> 00:10:03.078
D-Damn this thing!

00:10:04.884 --> 00:10:07.287
Stupid little... Piece of... Stupid...

00:10:07.287 --> 00:10:09.289
Damn this thing!

00:10:09.289 --> 00:10:11.157
Damn! Damn!!

00:10:11.157 --> 00:10:14.991
Damn it!

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:40.286
Long-distance relationships
have a bad influence on the body,

00:10:40.286 --> 00:10:44.657
which in turn will surely come to
threaten mankind with extinction!

00:10:44.657 --> 00:10:46.993
Long-distance relationships
are hereby banned!

00:10:46.993 --> 00:10:49.829
And those phone relationships
carried out via cellular phone

00:10:49.829 --> 00:10:52.423
are strictly prohibited!

00:10:56.135 --> 00:10:57.337
What's wrong?

00:10:57.337 --> 00:10:59.238
A malfunction?

00:10:59.238 --> 00:11:01.474
That's strange...

00:11:01.474 --> 00:11:03.237
Let's see...

00:11:04.811 --> 00:11:06.946
Wh-What in the world?

00:11:06.946 --> 00:11:08.381
What's the matter?

00:11:08.381 --> 00:11:10.917
My Mr. Surveillances! They're...

00:11:10.917 --> 00:11:12.785
They're... what?

00:11:12.785 --> 00:11:16.118
They're napping, goofing off,
and picking up women.

00:11:36.709 --> 00:11:39.812
You're beautiful! You're so beautiful!

00:11:39.812 --> 00:11:41.939
Go out with me!

00:11:45.251 --> 00:11:48.154
Washu! Hurry it up!

00:11:48.154 --> 00:11:50.623
Calm down, calm down...

00:11:50.623 --> 00:11:53.524
I have to figure out what's
causing the malfunction first.

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:59.523
Hey! I'm really ticked off!

00:12:14.213 --> 00:12:17.917
I declare a total ban on
long-distance relationships!

00:12:17.917 --> 00:12:21.320
This is the new commandment
set before humanity!

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:22.555
The new morality!

00:12:22.555 --> 00:12:26.184
The new order!

00:12:33.766 --> 00:12:35.825
Takkun? It's me.

00:12:38.237 --> 00:12:40.330
It's here!

00:12:42.341 --> 00:12:45.504
Long-distance relationships
are banned completely!

00:12:47.113 --> 00:12:50.879
Long-distance relationships
are banned completely!

00:12:51.751 --> 00:12:53.553
Banned! Banned!

00:12:53.553 --> 00:12:56.488
Long-distance relationships
are hereby banned!

00:12:58.758 --> 00:13:01.227
Washu, hurry it up, okay?

00:13:01.227 --> 00:13:06.164
Huh? That's strange...
That should have fixed it!

00:13:07.066 --> 00:13:08.901
Tenchi...

00:13:08.901 --> 00:13:10.236
I won't let it happen!

00:13:10.236 --> 00:13:12.872
The feelings of those men and
women separated by distance

00:13:12.872 --> 00:13:15.864
are never gonna get through!

00:13:19.078 --> 00:13:24.277
Go! Go and make a mess out
of long-distance relationships!

00:13:28.521 --> 00:13:31.257
Come on! Get moving!

00:13:31.257 --> 00:13:33.526
It's blocked up there!

00:13:33.526 --> 00:13:38.364
Tenchi and friends are
carrying desks up a flight of stairs!

00:13:38.364 --> 00:13:41.767
Tenchi has a team carrying
desks up a flight of stairs.

00:13:41.767 --> 00:13:44.203
I can't believe that guy!

00:13:44.203 --> 00:13:47.907
Tenchi Masaki is carrying
a desk up some stairs.

00:13:47.907 --> 00:13:49.609
If you're gonna whack him, do it now.

00:13:49.609 --> 00:13:52.445
Tenchi's climbing some stairs! That's all!

00:13:52.445 --> 00:13:55.548
That Tenchi Gang's
moving up, but they're too slow!

00:13:55.548 --> 00:13:58.050
Put yer backs into it!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:06.253
Tenchi is being pushed off
a cliff by a cow and a hippo.

00:14:07.126 --> 00:14:08.461
Reporting!

00:14:08.461 --> 00:14:12.795
Tenchi is about to be pushed
off a cliff by a cow and a hippo.

00:14:13.866 --> 00:14:16.035
H-How did that happen?

00:14:16.035 --> 00:14:17.900
What's going on around here?

00:14:23.709 --> 00:14:27.613
Oh, no! Tenchi's in a cage,
and people are trying to kill him!

00:14:27.613 --> 00:14:29.205
It was a suicide run!

00:14:30.249 --> 00:14:34.487
Tenchi got nailed. Looks like
he's holding something round.

00:14:34.487 --> 00:14:36.656
That round thing's an iron bullet.

00:14:36.656 --> 00:14:40.426
That Tenchi Masaki guy's crazy,
to step in front of an iron one...

00:14:40.426 --> 00:14:45.665
Not too shabby, Tenchi!
I liked that bit with the round thing!

00:14:45.665 --> 00:14:49.936
Round thing? Are you serious, Tenchi?
Are you trying to kill somebody?!

00:14:49.936 --> 00:14:54.941
Tenchi has been turned
into an ogre at Onigashima.

00:14:54.941 --> 00:14:57.501
He's being hit by round things.

00:14:59.111 --> 00:15:00.279
Reporting!

00:15:00.279 --> 00:15:02.248
Tenchi's been turned
into an ogre at Onigashima,

00:15:02.248 --> 00:15:04.350
and is being hit by round things!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:07.253
Are you trying to mess with us, Washu?!

00:15:07.253 --> 00:15:09.121
All right, damn it...

00:15:09.121 --> 00:15:10.356
How about this?!

00:15:10.356 --> 00:15:11.424
Reporting!

00:15:11.424 --> 00:15:13.593
Tenchi is making lovey-dovey
on a South Seas island!

00:15:13.593 --> 00:15:14.594
What?!

00:15:14.594 --> 00:15:17.791
T-Tenchi...

00:15:24.637 --> 00:15:27.707
Lying with his head on her lap,
enjoying the sunset on the beach...

00:15:27.707 --> 00:15:30.009
Not too shabby, Tenchi...

00:15:30.009 --> 00:15:31.670
Now look here, damn it!

00:15:37.617 --> 00:15:38.718
What's up?

00:15:38.718 --> 00:15:41.118
It's uh... It's nothing.

00:15:42.154 --> 00:15:43.656
I'd better head home.

00:15:43.656 --> 00:15:45.817
What, already?

00:15:46.993 --> 00:15:50.053
Oh, well. I'll walk with you halfway.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.933
Wh-What the heck is this?

00:15:53.933 --> 00:15:56.068
Tenchi...

00:15:56.068 --> 00:16:00.806
Sister! Pull yourself together!
It has to be some kind of mistake!

00:16:00.806 --> 00:16:02.241
Tenchi...

00:16:02.241 --> 00:16:06.145
Why? You have me, don't you?
This is cruel! It's too cruel!

00:16:06.145 --> 00:16:08.214
I can't do anything else from here!

00:16:08.214 --> 00:16:11.615
I'm gonna find out what's
behind this or die trying!

00:16:14.053 --> 00:16:16.889
Tenchi...

00:16:16.889 --> 00:16:20.484
He looks so cute in that elephant costume...

00:16:22.628 --> 00:16:24.391
"Tenchi"

00:16:24.764 --> 00:16:26.932
Lord Tenchi, why?

00:16:26.932 --> 00:16:31.028
Why are you practicing
calligraphy in an elephant costume?

00:16:34.173 --> 00:16:36.141
Sister! Hang in there!

00:16:36.942 --> 00:16:41.347
Tenchi... I want to go see you!
I want to go see you right now!

00:16:41.347 --> 00:16:44.976
Stop coming here to Tokyo all the time!

00:16:48.054 --> 00:16:49.989
This horse prayer token, then?

00:16:49.989 --> 00:16:52.191
That'll be 500 yen, please.

00:16:52.191 --> 00:16:54.794
T-Tenchi!

00:16:54.794 --> 00:16:56.762
Damn it!

00:16:57.763 --> 00:16:59.865
I've got it!

00:16:59.865 --> 00:17:02.068
Somebody's controlling my Mr. Surveillances...

00:17:02.068 --> 00:17:04.170
...with a powerful jamming signal!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.272
What? Where's it coming from?!

00:17:06.272 --> 00:17:09.075
Somewhere between here and Tokyo.

00:17:09.075 --> 00:17:11.477
I can't know for sure
without going out and looking.

00:17:11.477 --> 00:17:13.946
Great! Let's go, Sasami!

00:17:13.946 --> 00:17:18.484
Are you sure? Tenchi told
you not to go to Tokyo.

00:17:18.484 --> 00:17:20.145
Stop coming to Tokyo!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:26.158
I can't let this go on!
We just need to stay out of Tokyo!

00:17:26.158 --> 00:17:28.183
Ryo-Ohki? Do you mind?

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.427
Let's go, Ryo-Ohki!

00:17:39.572 --> 00:17:42.975
I don't care who it is...
This guy played me for a sucker...

00:17:42.975 --> 00:17:45.307
He's gonna pay!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:51.550
So, someone's trying to
interfere with my plans, huh?

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:57.113
I won't let them!
Your love must be destroyed!

00:17:58.758 --> 00:18:01.090
Here it comes, Ryoko!

00:18:05.231 --> 00:18:09.735
This is Aichi prefecture.
This isn't Tokyo, so it's okay, right?

00:18:09.735 --> 00:18:10.903
Right.

00:18:10.903 --> 00:18:12.838
Who the hell are you?!

00:18:12.838 --> 00:18:17.743
My name is Yoshiaki Zumino!
Cellular phone spirit!

00:18:17.743 --> 00:18:19.278
Yoshiaki Zumino?

00:18:19.278 --> 00:18:21.303
Bleah!

00:18:21.881 --> 00:18:26.619
This may go without saying, but,
thanks to the accumulation of misery

00:18:26.619 --> 00:18:29.422
felt by men who are dumped at the
end of a long-distance relationship,

00:18:29.422 --> 00:18:32.414
I am now able to do this!

00:18:34.894 --> 00:18:37.260
Long-distance relationships
are hereby banned!

00:18:37.329 --> 00:18:39.991
Long-distance relationships
are hereby banned!

00:18:41.634 --> 00:18:43.536
Sasami! Take us in closer!

00:18:43.536 --> 00:18:45.104
But what about those rays?!

00:18:45.104 --> 00:18:46.772
Just ram us down his throat!

00:18:46.772 --> 00:18:48.541
This is as close as we can go!

00:18:48.541 --> 00:18:50.443
Just a little more!

00:18:50.443 --> 00:18:53.279
He's gonna pay for stepping
all over my love for Tenchi!

00:18:53.279 --> 00:18:54.871
I'm gonna beat the crap out of him!

00:18:57.917 --> 00:19:00.686
Long-distance relationships
are hereby banned!

00:19:00.686 --> 00:19:01.787
No!

00:19:01.787 --> 00:19:03.277
Now!

00:19:10.429 --> 00:19:12.731
That's what happens to
those who try to interfere.

00:19:12.731 --> 00:19:14.722
You're the one who's interfering around here.

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:22.041
Anybody who tries to interfere with
people's long-distance relationships...

00:19:22.041 --> 00:19:23.809
l-It's not affecting her!

00:19:23.809 --> 00:19:26.437
...is gonna get the
snot beat out of 'em by me...

00:19:31.817 --> 00:19:34.411
...and get sent back where they came from!

00:19:35.621 --> 00:19:38.647
I'm sorry!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.934
Oh, yeah!

00:19:53.372 --> 00:19:54.673
Huh?

00:19:54.673 --> 00:19:56.265
What the heck's this?

00:19:57.743 --> 00:20:00.337
Nothing! Nothing at all!

00:20:03.315 --> 00:20:06.079
Now, that's more like it.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:11.685
I can't believe you
foisted that junk off on us...

00:20:12.725 --> 00:20:17.025
Maybe I'll study the data and
make a Mr. Surveillance Mk. II...

00:20:17.997 --> 00:20:19.632
Hey, guys!

00:20:19.632 --> 00:20:21.233
Tenchi!

00:20:21.233 --> 00:20:22.701
Lord Tenchi!

00:20:22.701 --> 00:20:24.169
Tenchi!

00:20:24.169 --> 00:20:26.171
I got some candy from Mr. Tsuchida,

00:20:26.171 --> 00:20:29.341
so I was wondering if you might
want get some tea and eat 'em with me.

00:20:29.341 --> 00:20:31.070
Lord Tenchi!

00:20:33.045 --> 00:20:34.774
Ow...

00:20:35.548 --> 00:20:42.511
Oh, Lord Tenchi... I've been
worried sick about you all day!

00:20:46.825 --> 00:20:50.329
We'd better go put
some tea on right away, then!

00:20:50.329 --> 00:20:51.887
Right!

00:20:53.866 --> 00:20:55.857
Did something happen?

00:21:00.105 --> 00:21:02.767
No, not really.

00:21:03.842 --> 00:21:05.309
Oh.

00:21:36.208 --> 00:21:39.812
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.812 --> 00:21:43.716
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.716 --> 00:21:47.319
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.319 --> 00:21:51.256
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.256 --> 00:21:54.760
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:58.731
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.731 --> 00:22:02.067
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.067 --> 00:22:06.071
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.071 --> 00:22:08.207
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.207 --> 00:22:10.142
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.142 --> 00:22:11.644
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.644 --> 00:22:17.483
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.483 --> 00:22:21.587
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.587 --> 00:22:24.857
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.857 --> 00:22:28.394
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.394 --> 00:22:33.093
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:42.274 --> 00:22:44.309
Hi! Sasami here!

00:22:44.309 --> 00:22:47.179
Huh? Tenchi's getting married to Sakuya?

00:22:47.179 --> 00:22:50.182
Yahoo! I'm happy!
I'm embarrassed! Wedding bells!

00:22:50.182 --> 00:22:52.484
But this is no time to be fooling around!

00:22:52.484 --> 00:22:57.156
If Ryoko and Ayeka find out,
it's gonna rain blood!

00:22:57.156 --> 00:22:59.458
But something seems strange...

00:22:59.458 --> 00:23:01.593
What is it about that house?

00:23:01.593 --> 00:23:04.196
I'm in a huff!

00:23:04.196 --> 00:23:10.157
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"The Eternal Pledge."
